7592186246914 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533688 true] [17592186246914 1100 "If $sec⁡x=3\\sqrt{3},$ then what is $sec⁡(x+8\\pi )?$" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246914 1113 #uuid "b2f84c41-54d9-5d26-a43f-85f7af5ae1ae" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246914 1138 false 13194139533688 true] [17592186246914 1145 "The period of $y=sec⁡x$ is $2\\pi .$ Therefore, for integer $n$ we have\n\n$$\nsec⁡x=sec⁡(x+2n\\pi ).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=4$ into the right-hand-side of the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}sec⁡x=sec⁡(x+2\\cdot 4\\cdot \\pi )=sec⁡(x+8\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $sec⁡x=3\\sqrt{3},$ then $sec⁡(x+8\\pi )=3\\sqrt{3}.$" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246916 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246917 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246918 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246919 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246920 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1041 "selection" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246918 13194139533688 true] [17592186246915 1110 #uuid "4a71cce0-0d24-5b37-b589-91ec75d64121" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246916 1034 "3+\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246916 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533688 true] [17592186246916 1111 #uuid "257d8569-1596-5447-96fe-73f1729cb4f1" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246917 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246917 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533688 true] [17592186246917 1111 #uuid "cc058cc2-6299-55de-91fa-ec39d31c2150" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246918 1034 "3\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246918 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533688 true] [17592186246918 1111 #uuid "d60635c1-223f-53ea-b9a0-dae4c08def05" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246919 1034 "\\sqrt{3}-3" 13194139533688 true] [17592186246919 1103 #edb/ref